### Create a new thread for an agent
POST http://localhost:3000/thread/agent/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "agentId": 1
}

### Get all threads for an agent
GET http://localhost:3000/thread/agent/1

### Get a specific thread with messages
GET http://localhost:3000/thread/1

### Send a message to a thread (this will auto-generate thread name)
POST http://localhost:3000/thread/1/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "I need help analyzing some data from our latest customer survey"
}

### Delete a thread
DELETE http://localhost:3000/thread/1